<title>ESTONIA: HUVITUSFOND PROFIT DOWN IN MAY.</title>
<headline>HUVITUSFOND PROFIT DOWN IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huvitusfond (Compensation Fund) said on Wednesday that it had a profit of 6.96 million kroons in May compared to 10.5 million kroons the previous month.</p>
<p>Huvitusfond's current year profit was 59.3 million kroons at the end of May, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Its assets were 1.34 billion kroons, an increase of 1.6 percent or 21 million kroons compared to April.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
